# Backend Rules (FastAPI + uv)

Read dedicated rules under `.agents/rules/backend/`:
- `.agents/rules/backend/architecture-and-layering.md`
- `.agents/rules/backend/security-and-multitenancy.md`
- `.agents/rules/backend/code-quality-and-testing.md`

## Invariants
1. 5-Layer architecture: Routers -> Services -> Repositories -> Models -> Utils.
2. Multi-tenancy: Every record must have `user_id`. Never trust user input for `user_id`.
3. Financial math: strictly positive amounts (`amount > 0`), 2-decimal rounding.
4. Safe category deletion: reject deletion if referenced by transactions or budgets.
5. Verification:
   - `uv run ruff check .`
   - `uv run ruff format --check .`
   - `uv run mypy app`
   - `uv run pytest`
